.SH NAME
le-restart - Restart a listener through its verified Homebrew service


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle restart [port|pid] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Restart a listener only when its current Homebrew launchd job owns the
selected PID. Docker/container helpers require manual ownership checks;
other listeners have no supported automatic restart.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for restart


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBle(1)\fP


